{"id": "EUVD-2026-102295", "enisaUuid": "8d52b914-4640-3fa3-85d2-534cfa4e5059", "description": "LibreDesk before 2.9.0-rc.8 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows authenticated agents to execute script by uploading SVGs with malformed Content-Type parameters. Attackers can upload an SVG typed 'image/svg+xml; x' via /api/v1/media so GET /uploads/{uuid} serves it inline without sandbox, running script in any viewing agent's or administrator's session.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T19:40:44", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/abhinavxd/libredesk/pull/641", "https://github.com/abhinavxd/libredesk/commit/ab3a5ca682fcc1caec0950fc607b66caea49bec3", "https://github.com/abhinavxd/libredesk/blob/086b08200d667f2cc083635e925d6f5e7b0097e3/cmd/media.go#L255-L272", "https://github.com/abhinavxd/libredesk/blob/086b08200d667f2cc083635e925d6f5e7b0097e3/internal/media/media.go#L422-L433", "https://github.com/abhinavxd/libredesk/releases/tag/v2.9.0-rc.8", "https://github.com/abhinavxd/libredesk", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libredesk-before-2.9.0-rc.8-stored-xss-via-svg-upload-content-type-parameter"], "aliases": ["GHSA-wvrw-g5q5-xxgm", "CVE-2026-111168"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f17410ac-b041-330f-8e41-f056f84529a1", "product": {"name": "libredesk", "vendor": {"name": "abhinavxd"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.9.0-rc.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e8051aca-4869-3e9c-9e91-3c9c47e71106", "vendor": {"name": "abhinavxd"}}], "isExploited": false}